### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### List first page
GET http://localhost:3000/students?page=1&size=5

### List second page
GET http://localhost:3000/students?page=2&size=5

### Create
POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "matricNo": "A21CS9999",
 "name": "Test Student",
 "course": "BSc CS",
 "faculty": "FSKSM",
 "gpa": 3.50,
 "email": "test@graduate.utm.my",
 "year": 1,
 "active": true
}

### Validation error example
POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "matricNo": "bad",
 "name": "T",
 "course": "",
 "faculty": "",
 "gpa": 9,
 "email": "not-an-email",
 "year": 9,
 "active": true
}

### Toggle active with PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:3000/students/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "active": false
}

### Update (replace 6 with the id returned above)
PUT http://localhost:3000/students/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "matricNo": "A21CS9999",
 "name": "Test Student Updated",
 "course": "BSc CS",
 "faculty": "FSKSM",
 "gpa": 3.80,
 "email": "test@graduate.utm.my",
 "year": 2,
 "active": true
}

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/students/6
